<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  A discreet launcher icon: a notes page (M8).

  Drawn rather than borrowed. Nothing here imitates a real product's mark — no other app's
  name, colours or glyph — because an icon that passes for somebody else's app is what Play's
  deceptive-behaviour policy is about. This is a generic page with three rules on it, which is
  what a notes icon has looked like since before any of them.

  Inside the 66 dp safe zone of a 108 dp adaptive icon, so no launcher mask clips it.
-->
